l3(36,'Sum of Neighbor Peak Elements','Replace each peak with itself plus its existing immediate neighbors. A peak is >= every existing neighbor. Determine all peaks and sums from the original array, simultaneously. Non-peaks stay unchanged.',"r=a.copy()\nfor i,x in enumerate(a):\n    neighbors=a[max(0,i-1):i]+a[i+1:i+2]\n    if all(x>=v for v in neighbors):r[i]=x+sum(neighbors)\nemit(r)",arr([7,4,5,2,1,8]),'11 4 11 2 1 9',note='The source reads outside array bounds and modifies values while detecting peaks. This contract uses existing neighbors and simultaneous updates to make results deterministic.')
